  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, whenever a creature fails a Will saving throw to disbelieve the shadow weaver's illusions, it and all observers suffer a –2 penalty on saving throws to disbelieve the shadow weaver's illusions for 1 day. It gets no new save to disbelieve that illusion until it interacts with that illusion in a different manner (repeated attacks do not allow repeated saves, but an attack followed by close visual scrutiny as a move action would allow two saves).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shadow-weaver#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
